                                            // BOOT_SLUMBER_OPTION=0, then both arc vote indexes, and only then rings the
                                            // doorbell; a6xx_sptprac_enable() follows the doorbell.
                                            //
                                            // The arc vote index is 0 for both rails: upstream derives it from the RPMh
